{"id":"n89906-14-19","stage":0,"title":"내다 · 交","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89906-14-19-1","ko":"민준이는 일을 그만둔 거야?","zh":"敏俊辞职了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준이는","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"민준이는","audio":"/audio/068c382ba3282b86786d.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준이는","audio":"/audio/068c382ba3282b86786d.mp3"}},{"text":"일을","meaning":"事，工作","explanation":"일：事，工作；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"5","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일을","audio":"/audio/9a5fd6c2b18669a93295.mp3"}},{"text":"그만둔","meaning":"罢休，放弃","explanation":"그만두다：罢休，放弃；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"그만두다","audio":"/audio/55dca49e4d54e352750e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62318","senseId":"2","lemma":"그만두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그만둔","audio":"/audio/056116267955ed44d57c.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"需要解决或处理的问题或事项。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"55dca49e4d54e352","term":"그만두다","zh":"罢休，放弃","audio":"/audio/55dca49e4d54e352750e.mp3","entryId":"62318","definition":"不做打算以后要做的事情。","pronunciation":["그만두다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/a02d46a49cdcb20fd40a.mp3","speak